OL,3,GNEWSAMock funeral planned for last
OL,4,Avillage cash machine
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a village are planning a
OL,7,Fmock funeral for its only cash machine
OL,8,Fif it is removed.
OL,10,FThe Barclays machine in St Agnes,
OL,11,FCornwall, was due to close on 11
OL,12,FDecember after Link, which manages the
OL,13,Fmachine, said residents and businesses
OL,14,Fcould access cash from the Post Office.
OL,16,FThat decision was criticised and
OL,17,Fresidents said they planned to mark any
OL,18,Fremoval in January by carrying a coffin
OL,19,Femblazoned with the bank's logo while
OL,20,Fdressed in black.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
