OL,3,GNEWSAMock funeral planned for last
OL,4,Avillage cash machine
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Council member Pete Mitchell
OL,7,Fsaid local life without the machine
OL,8,Fwould be a "disaster". The machine said
OL,9,Fin an on-screen message it was to
OL,10,F"remain open for now" while Link
OL,11,Fassessed local needs, with a closure
OL,12,Fdate to be announced.
